      "nonstandard_elements": "Reported 'browsing through time' with detailed memories from before speech, and a brief scene of the world's future (year 'four thousand and something', sun 'shooting balls of fire', locusts, darkness). Return felt like being attached to a cord that was jerked downward after a 'pop'.",
